{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826270/extras/9dd1aed76eaa76b9f7a27e2583170d24.poster.avif?t=1752756504\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826270/extras/9dd1aed76eaa76b9f7a27e2583170d24.webm?t=1752756504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826270/extras/9dd1aed76eaa76b9f7a27e2583170d24.mp4?t=1752756504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wreak havoc across the galaxy as a sanitation worker with nothing to lose.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re <strong>Drax Gorbuloid</strong>\u2014a low-level grunt cleaning up cosmic trash for a sinister mega-corporation called Binary Express. When the job goes sideways, you\u2019ll have to race, sabotage, and blast your way across alien worlds in an open-ended struggle for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore planets. Break stuff. Get rich or die trying.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive, hijack, or fight your way across vibrant alien cities, slums, and sewer zones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on shady gigs, corporate sabotage, or just cause chaos for fun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight off debt collectors, corporate enforcers, and mutated space freaks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover secrets of the Binary Express megacorp\u2014and maybe bring it all crashing down.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A colorful sandbox full of cosmic chaos and hilarious hijinks.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zoom through space cities, mess with alien tech, and take odd jobs from bizarre characters\u2014or just cause mischief for the fun of it. There\u2019s always something wild to do, somewhere strange to explore, and some rule to break.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you love open-world adventures, quirky aliens, and games that let you play your way\u2014<strong>this is your kind of galaxy.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3826270?t=1752756504","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826270/3920f656a282383e3f58ade1d40e3d193b4d7111/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752756504","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826270/01ee21e9e3fa57cb163f563986e9f25c6ae1c644/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752756504","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826270/01ee21e9e3fa57cb163f563986e9f25c6ae1c644/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752756504","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826270/extras/9dd1aed76eaa76b9f7a27e2583170d24.poster.avif?t=1752756504\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826270/extras/9dd1aed76eaa76b9f7a27e2583170d24.webm?t=1752756504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826270/extras/9dd1aed76eaa76b9f7a27e2583170d24.mp4?t=1752756504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wreak havoc across the galaxy as a sanitation worker with nothing to lose.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re <strong>Drax Gorbuloid</strong>\u2014a low-level grunt cleaning up cosmic trash for a sinister mega-corporation called Binary Express. When the job goes sideways, you\u2019ll have to race, sabotage, and blast your way across alien worlds in an open-ended struggle for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore planets. Break stuff. Get rich or die trying.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive, hijack, or fight your way across vibrant alien cities, slums, and sewer zones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on shady gigs, corporate sabotage, or just cause chaos for fun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight off debt collectors, corporate enforcers, and mutated space freaks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover secrets of the Binary Express megacorp\u2014and maybe bring it all crashing down.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A colorful sandbox full of cosmic chaos and hilarious hijinks.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zoom through space cities, mess with alien tech, and take odd jobs from bizarre characters\u2014or just cause mischief for the fun of it. There\u2019s always something wild to do, somewhere strange to explore, and some rule to break.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you love open-world adventures, quirky aliens, and games that let you play your way\u2014<strong>this is your kind of galaxy.</strong></p>","developers":["Pantelis Kassotis"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826270/8ed6e7c7c885278614b1eea5b5e80e47d4400bfc/header.jpg?t=17527565